      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on this site in the peloponnese and the ceramic scatter is really weird. i've got these clusters of shards that look like they were just tossed there, almost like they were disturbed or moved, rather than being a natural collapse of a structure. any idea why we'd see such an irregular, almost chaotic distribution of fragments in a single layer?",
